ravenrs-pdf
===========

The code under src/ and tests/ comes from PdfCraft (https://github.com/storytold/pdfcraft), commit
175992b5a2045d00cdf8a20f812ea4aac522b099: its crates geom, crypt, filters, cos, model, content,
fonts, render and organize, and the test helpers oracle and testkit (src/testing), brought
together as modules of this one crate by scripts/storytold/convert.py.

